                &kp 0x000700E0 &trans &trans &trans &trans &trans &kp 0x0007002D &kp 0x0007002E &kp 0x0007002F &kp 0x00070030 &kp 0x00070031 &kp 0x00070035
                &kp 0x000700E1 &trans &trans &trans &trans &trans &kp 0x0207002D &kp 0x0207002E &kp 0x0207002F &kp 0x02070030 &kp 0x02070031 &kp 0x02070035
